"""Paper 1 · Current Affairs: April and May 2026 (75% Karnataka, 25% national). Each month = "1 · Karnataka" (30 Q) + "2 · National"
(10 Q). Every fact was checked on the web and the source is named in each explanation; "Background" questions add settled facts linked
to the month's news. Where sources disagreed the safer wording is used (e.g. the IPL final is not given a date: reports say 31 May or
1 June). Left out: NammaKPSC's internal-quota split 25:25:5 (contradicted by news reports of 5.25:5.25:4.5); BESCOM's '51st of 54'
rank (single source); the 'first in India' tag for the NSQ/NDPS drug portal (only exam-prep sites claim it)."""
